# Scored xmlconf cases this parser gets wrong, one per line: <id><TAB><reason>.
#
# Every one is a not-well-formed document that is accepted, and every one is
# not-well-formed only because of something inside a DTD: the internal subset
# is *skipped* in Phase 1 (a bounded scanner finds its end, checks characters
# and that each declaration is delimited, and nothing more), and external
# subsets and entities are never loaded. Phase 4 parses declarations and is
# where these start being refused; the list should shrink to nothing then.
#
# tools/conformance/xmlconf_suite.py fails the gate on a scored case that
# fails and is not listed here, AND on a listed case that no longer fails, so
# an entry cannot outlive its reason. Do not add a case without reading it:
# none of these is a defect in what Phase 1 promises, and a new failure that
# looks like one of them usually is not.
